              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaiha omu ndembo zoona eza Yuda emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, n'ebyoterero by'okwotereraho obubaane. Obugabe bwagira obuhuumure omu busingye bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 15:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaayombeka endembo ezeehinguririziibwe amabaare omuri Yuda, ahakuba ensi ekaba eine obusingye. Omuri egyo myaka tiyaagira ngamba; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akamuha obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagira Abayuda ati: Ka twombekye endembo ezi, tuzeehinguririze engo z'amabaare, tuzombekyeho eminaara, n'amarembo againe enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi; ensi ekiri eyaitu, ahabw'okuba tusherwire MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; tumusherwire, nawe yaatuha obusingye embaju zoona. Batyo baayombeka, baaba gye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Asa akaba aine eihe ry'abashaija obusiriira bushatu b'abarugire Yuda abaine engabo n'amacumu, n'abarugire Benyamiini obusiriira bubiri n'obukumi munaana, ab'engabo n'amata; abo boona bakaba bari abashaija b'amaani amamanzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
